@startuml a05-l3-aiservice
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Building Block View — Level 3: Whitebox "AIService" (the two AI seams)

package "AIService (whitebox) — app/Services/AIService.php" {
  [Transcription seam\ntranscribe(string audioPath): string] as tseam
  [Generation seam\nchat(string system, string user,\nfloat temp = 0.3): array] as gseam
  [Shared plumbing\nBearer key from config('herold.openai.api_key'),\nbaseUrl https://api.openai.com/v1,\nfail-fast constructor] as shared
}

cloud "OpenAI Transcription API\nPOST /v1/audio/transcriptions\nmodel gpt-4o-transcribe (NB-02)" as whisper
cloud "OpenAI Chat Completion API\nPOST /v1/chat/completions\nmodel gpt-5.4-mini (NB-03)" as chat

tseam ..> shared
gseam ..> shared
tseam --> whisper : multipart audio +\nresponse_format text,\ntimeout 120 s
gseam --> chat : JSON, response_format\njson_object, temperature 0.3;\nrequires title + body keys

note bottom of shared
  NB-02 and NB-03 are distinct neighbours (S1.3 / S1.4)
  and QG-04 demands replaceability per seam. Today both
  seams are methods of one class sharing credential and
  base URL; a provider switch cuts along exactly these
  two seam lines. Model identifiers are hard-coded —
  risk R-07 / debt D-07(f).
end note

@enduml
